<metadata><name>Galičica trail H-7</name><desc>H-7 is one of Galičica National Park's easier and shorter hiking trails. It runs 2.6 km from Sharbojca mountain house (Asan Djura) to Samotska Dupka Cave, climbing about 51 m and descending 113 m in the direction drawn, between 1,404 m and 1,505 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/h-7/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
